  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 60 * 40 * 10 * 50 * 100 * 160\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ×, ÷ , – , + , =\n\n60 * 40 * 10 * 50 * 100 * 160 ⇒ 60 × 40 ÷ 10 - 50 + 100 = 160\n\n⇒ 60 × __**40 **____**÷**____** 10**__ - 50 + 100 = 160\n\n⇒ __**60 × 4**__ - 50 + 100 = 160\n\n⇒ __**2**____**40 +**____** 100**__ - 50 = 160\n\n⇒ __3____40____** - 50**__ = 160\n\n⇒ 290 ≠ 160 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2)&nb",
